{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786604908736,"sessionID":"ses_0060d0225ffe6aY2TL9kC9SIMN","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_00_I5zb8S7qnQFGmVvJFJV72010","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0144-system-deep-loop-036-p0-remediation/specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/057-phase-consolidation-research/spec.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0144-system-deep-loop-036-p0-remediation/specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/057-phase-consolidation-research/spec.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: title: \"Phase Consolidation Research\"\n3: description: \"Research whether the 036 phase-parent children can be merged into fewer larger multi-phase groups.\"\n4: ---\n5: # Phase Consolidation Research\n6: Deep-research host: can the 036 child phase folders be merged/grouped into fewer, larger multi-phased phases?\n\n(End of file - total 6 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"---\ntitle: \"Phase Consolidation Research\"\ndescription: \"Research whether the 036 phase-parent children can be merged into fewer larger multi-phase groups.\"\n---\n# Phase Consolidation Research\nDeep-research host: can the 036 child phase folders be merged/grouped into fewer, larger multi-phased phases?","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0144-system-deep-loop-036-p0-remediation/specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/057-phase-consolidation-research/spec.md","text":"---\ntitle: \"Phase Consolidation Research\"\ndescription: \"Research whether the 036 phase-parent children can be merged into fewer larger multi-phase groups.\"\n---\n# Phase Consolidation Research\nDeep-research host: can the 036 child phase folders be merged/grouped into fewer, larger multi-phased phases?","lineStart"