 2026-07-31T01:25:21.765Z  2026-08-08T01:03:36.881Z  032-docs-drift-and-p2-batch\n34. 2026-08-05T18:42:31.847Z  2026-08-08T00:39:36.210Z  033-identity-and-lock-ownership-hardening\n35. 2026-08-07T07:50:32Z  2026-08-07T08:02:34.951Z  035-cli-adapter-stress-and-playbooks\n36. 2026-08-08T07:14:10.069Z  2026-08-08T07:14:10.069Z  047-executor-wiring-and-parity\n37. 2026-08-08T07:14:11.279Z  2026-08-08T07:14:11.279Z  048-write-containment-hardening\n38. 2026-08-08T07:14:12.196Z  2026-08-08T07:14:12.196Z  049-deep-alignment-integrity\n39. 2026-08-12T16:44:22.542Z  2026-08-12T18:43:57.664Z  051-residual-finding-closeouts\n40. 2026-08-12T20:56:31.733Z  2026-08-12T21:11:53.970Z  052-cli-devin-executor-repair\n41. 2026-08-13T05:43:08.924Z  2026-08-13T06:48:30.276Z  053-runtime-code-review\n42. 2026-08-13T06:44:37.262Z  2026-08-13T06:48:30.593Z  054-review-drift-remediation\n43. 2026-08-13T06:44:37.411Z  2026-08-13T06:48:30.938Z  055-rollback-candidate-hash-hardening\n44. 2026-08-13T06:44:37.562Z  2026-08-13T06:48:31.280Z  056-review-containment-exemption\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json, glob, os\nbase='specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation'\nrows=[]\nfor d in sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(base,'[0-9][0-9][0-9]-*'))):\n    b=os.path.basename(d)\n    gm=os.path.join(d,'graph-metadata.json')\n    if not os.path.exists(gm): continue\n    der=json.load(open(gm)).get('derived',{})\n    c=der.get('created_at'); s=der.get('last_save_at')\n    rows.append((c or '?', s or '?', b))\nrows.sort(key=lambda r:(r[0] or '9999'))\nprint(\"Chronological order by created_at (earliest -> latest):\")\nfor i,(c,s,b) in enumerate(rows,1):\n    print(f\"{i:>2}. {c}  {s}  {b}\")\nEOF","time":{"start":1786605556639,"end":1786605556642}},"id":"prt_ff9fd4f76001KABUTdpnVdFVEQ","sessionID":"ses_0060d0225ffe6aY2TL9kC9SIMN","messageID":"msg_ff9fd350e001LoA5JtPoPQ2f57"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1786605556701,"sessionID":"ses_0060d0225ffe6aY2TL9kC9SIMN","part":{"id":"prt_ff9fd4d80001NwxrtKdT9WnDG2","messageID":"msg_ff9fd350e001LoA5JtPoPQ2f57","sessionID":"ses_0060d0225ffe6aY2TL9kC9SIMN","type":"text","text":"Git earliest-commits are dominated by the 2026-08-07 specs-root flip (every path re-touched), so git alone is unreliable for per-child chronology. The graph-metadata `created_at` timestamps are the cleaner signal. Let me build the chronological order from created_at and verify a key anomaly.","time":{"start":1786605555072,"end":1786605556699}}}
